\c 2
\p 
\v 1 \w And when any| strong="H5315" \w* [will offer]{strong=“H7126” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w a meat| strong="H4503" \w* \w offering| strong="H7133" \w* unto the \sc Lord\sc*, \w his offering| strong="H7133" \w* shall be of \w fine flour| strong="H5560" \w*; [and he shall pour]{strong=“H3332” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w oil| strong="H8081" \w* [upon it, and put]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w frankincense| strong="H3828" \w* thereon: 
