\p
\v 4 [And if thou bring]{strong=“H7126” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w an oblation| strong="H7133" \w* \w of a meat offering| strong="H4503" \w* \w baken| strong="H3989" \w* \w in the oven| strong="H8574" \w*, it shall be \w unleavened| strong="H4682" \w* \w cakes| strong="H2471" \w* \w of fine flour| strong="H5560" \w* [mingled]{strong=“H1101” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} \w with oil| strong="H8081" \w*, \w or unleavened| strong="H4682" \w* \w wafers| strong="H7550" \w* [anointed ]{strong=“H4886” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} \w with oil| strong="H8081" \w*. 
\p
\v 5 \w And if thy oblation| strong="H7133" \w* be \w a meat offering| strong="H4503" \w* baken \w in a pan| strong="H4227" \w*, it shall be of \w fine flour| strong="H5560" \w* \w unleavened| strong="H4682" \w*, [mingled]{strong=“H1101” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} \w with oil| strong="H8081" \w*.\f + \fr 2:5 \ft in a pan: or, on a flat plate, or, slice \f* 
