\p
\v 7 \w And if thy oblation| strong="H7133" \w* be \w a meat offering| strong="H4503" \w* baken \w in the fryingpan| strong="H4802" \w*, [it shall be made]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} of \w fine flour| strong="H5560" \w* \w with oil| strong="H8081" \w*. 
