\v 9 \w And the priest| strong="H3548" \w* [shall take]{strong=“H7311” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w from the meat offering| strong="H4503" \w* \w a memorial| strong="H234" \w* [thereof, and shall burn]{strong=“H6999” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} it \w upon the altar| strong="H4196" \w*: it is \w an offering made by fire| strong="H801" \w*, \w of a sweet| strong="H5207" \w* \w savour| strong="H7381" \w* unto the \sc Lord\sc*. 
