\c 3
\p 
\v 1 \w And if his oblation| strong="H7133" \w* be \w a sacrifice| strong="H2077" \w* \w of peace offering| strong="H8002" \w*, [if he offer]{strong=“H7126” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} it \w of the herd| strong="H1241" \w*; whether it be \w a male| strong="H2145" \w* \w or female| strong="H5347" \w*, [he shall offer]{strong=“H7126” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w it without blemish| strong="H8549" \w* \w before| strong="H6440" \w* the \sc Lord\sc*. 
