\v 40 [And the man]{strong=“H3588 H376”} [whose hair is fallen]{strong=“H4803” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w off his head| strong="H7218" \w*, he is \w bald| strong="H7142" \w*; yet is \w he clean| strong="H2889" \w*.\f + \fr 13:40 \ft hair…: Heb. head is pilled \f* 
\v 41 [And he that hath his hair fallen]{strong=“H4803” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w off from the part| strong="H6285" \w* \w of his head| strong="H7218" \w* \w toward his face| strong="H6440" \w*, he is \w forehead bald| strong="H1371" \w*: yet is \w he clean| strong="H2889" \w*. 
\v 42 \w And if there be in the bald head| strong="H7146" \w*, \w or bald forehead| strong="H1372" \w*, \w a white| strong="H3836" \w* \w reddish| strong="H125" \w* \w sore| strong="H5061" \w*; it is \w a leprosy| strong="H6883" \w* [sprung]{strong=“H6524” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w up in his bald head| strong="H7146" \w*, \w or his bald forehead| strong="H1372" \w*. 
\v 43 \w Then the priest| strong="H3548" \w* [shall look]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} upon it: and, behold, if \w the rising| strong="H7613" \w* \w of the sore| strong="H5061" \w* be \w white| strong="H3836" \w* \w reddish| strong="H125" \w* \w in his bald head| strong="H7146" \w*, \w or in his bald forehead| strong="H1372" \w*, \w as the leprosy| strong="H6883" \w* \w appeareth| strong="H4758" \w* \w in the skin| strong="H5785" \w* \w of the flesh| strong="H1320" \w*; 
