\v 46 \w All the days| strong="H3117" \w* \w wherein the plague| strong="H5061" \w* shall be [in him he shall be defiled]{strong=“H2930” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}; he is \w unclean| strong="H2931" \w*: [he shall dwell]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w alone| strong="H910" \w*; \w without| strong="H2351" \w* \w the camp| strong="H4264" \w* shall \w his habitation| strong="H4186" \w* be. 
\p
\v 47 \w The garment| strong="H899" \w* \w also that the plague| strong="H5061" \w* \w of leprosy| strong="H6883" \w* is in, whether it be \w a woollen| strong="H6785" \w* \w garment| strong="H899" \w*, \w or a linen| strong="H6593" \w* \w garment| strong="H899" \w*; 
\v 48 Whether it be \w in the warp| strong="H8359" \w*, \w or woof| strong="H6154" \w*; \w of linen| strong="H6593" \w*, \w or of woollen| strong="H6785" \w*; \w whether in a skin| strong="H5785" \w*, \w or in any thing made| strong="H4399" \w* \w of skin| strong="H5785" \w*;\f + \fr 13:48 \ft thing…: Heb. work of \f* 
