\v 52 [He shall therefore burn]{strong=“H8313” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w that garment| strong="H899" \w*, \w whether warp| strong="H8359" \w* \w or woof| strong="H6154" \w*, \w in woollen| strong="H6785" \w* \w or in linen| strong="H6593" \w*, \w or any thing| strong="H3627" \w* \w of skin| strong="H5785" \w*, \w wherein the plague| strong="H5061" \w* is: for it is [a fretting]{strong=“H3992” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} \w leprosy| strong="H6883" \w*; [it shall be burnt]{strong=“H8313” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w in the fire| strong="H784" \w*. 
