\v 56 \w And if the priest| strong="H3548" \w* [look]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [and, behold, the plague]{strong=“H5061”} be \w somewhat dark| strong="H3544" \w* \w after| strong="H310" \w* [the washing]{strong=“H3526” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8718”} [of it; then he shall rend]{strong=“H7167” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w it out of the garment| strong="H899" \w*, \w or out of the skin| strong="H5785" \w*, \w or out of the warp| strong="H8359" \w*, \w or out of the woof| strong="H6154" \w*: 
