\v 13 [And he shall slay]{strong=“H7819” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the lamb| strong="H3532" \w* \w in the place| strong="H4725" \w* [where he shall kill]{strong=“H7819” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the sin offering| strong="H2403" \w* \w and the burnt offering| strong="H5930" \w*, \w in the holy| strong="H6944" \w* \w place| strong="H4725" \w*: \w for as the sin offering| strong="H2403" \w* is [the priest’s]{strong=“H3548”}, so is \w the trespass offering| strong="H817" \w*: it is \w most| strong="H6944" \w* \w holy| strong="H6944" \w*: 
