\v 54 [And if he be not redeemed]{strong=“H1350” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} in these years, [then he shall go out]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w in the year| strong="H8141" \w* \w of jubile| strong="H3104" \w*, both [he, and his children]{strong=“H1121”} with him.\f + \fr 25:54 \ft in these…: or, by these means \f* 
\v 55 \w For unto me the children| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w* are \w servants| strong="H5650" \w*; they are \w my servants| strong="H5650" \w* [whom I brought forth]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w out of the land| strong="H776" \w* \w of Egypt| strong="H4714" \w*: I am the \sc Lord\sc* \w your God| strong="H430" \w*.
\c 26
\p 
\v 1 [Ye shall make]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w you no idols| strong="H457" \w* \w nor graven image| strong="H6459" \w*, [neither rear you up]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w a standing image| strong="H4676" \w*, [neither shall ye set up]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} any \w image| strong="H4906" \w* \w of stone| strong="H68" \w* \w in your land| strong="H776" \w*, [to bow down]{strong=“H7812” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8692”} unto it: for I am the \sc Lord\sc* \w your God| strong="H430" \w*.\f + \fr 26:1 \ft standing…: or, pillar \f* \f + \fr 26:1 \ft image of…: or, figured stone: Heb. a stone of picture \f* 
